SUMMARY:Cheap power ≤ €10 10:30-16:00 (confirmed)
DESCRIPTION:Wholesale power in Spain is at or below €10/MWh from 10:30 to
  16:00 Madrid time on Thu 12 Nov 2026. Lowest €1.09/MWh\, average €2.7
 8/MWh.\nConfirmed: OMIE day-ahead market result\, published around 13:00 M
 adrid time the day before.\nPVPC (regulated 2.0TD tariff): about 9.3 c/kWh
  in these hours\, period P1 punta / P2 llano (10:30–16:00). Grid tolls a
 nd charges still apply\, so retail power is never free\; it is just at its
  cheapest.\nGood hours to run the dishwasher or washing machine\, charge a
 n EV or heat water.\nWholesale price\, not your retail bill.\nSource: OMIE
  (omie.es). More: https://jvanders22.github.io/spain-negative-price-alert/
 calendar/
